    {
      "id": "c-shiji-063-laohan:p008",
      "text": "世之學老子者則絀儒學，儒學亦絀老子。「道不同不相為謀」，豈謂是邪？李耳無為自化，清靜自正。",
      "annotation_status": "named_mentions_first_pass",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-shiji-063-laohan:m008-0003",
          "start": 3,
          "end": 5,
          "surface": "老子",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "q4v_vmz_dvi",
          "status": "contextual_provisional"
        },
        {
